## all generated at build time: the CSL, packages.bib, references_SpaDES.bib and
## referencesLandRManual.bib, which build.R assembles from the module
## bibliographies. The negation that used to keep referencesLandRManual.bib
## tracked described an intention, not a fact -- it was never committed, and the
## manual has no references of its own to commit. A tracked
## references_manual.bib would belong here if that changes.
citations/*

## rendered output; published to the gh-pages branch by the workflow, and no
## longer committed here -- a committed copy rode along into every deploy
docs/

## module sources, checked out by the manual's workflow (see .github/workflows)
modules/

## project-local R library, created by Require when a build runs here. It is
## entirely rebuildable, and the copy found in October 2026 was 618 MB of R 4.2
## packages last written to in May 2022 -- unloadable by any R now in use, and
## 10k untracked files between a reader and their own changes.
packages/

## generated chapters (SpaDES.docs::prepManualRmds)
_manual_rmds/

# produced vignettes
vignettes/*.html
vignettes/*.pdf

# OAuth2 token, see https://github.com/hadley/httr/releases/tag/v0.3
.httr-oauth

# knitr and R markdown default cache directories
*_cache/
/cache/

## these are downloaded automatically, no point in caching
figures/*Badge.png

# Temporary files created by R markdown
*.utf8.md
*.knit.md

# R Environment Variables
.Renviron

# misc
reprex.R
